                                                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed sm:mb-0 text-gray-400">
                                                    Our team's success is defined by innovation. In this featured spotlight, we talk with Caleigh Campion about her work on the <b>RFP Gem</b> project and the critical role internal initiatives play in driving team efficiency and strategic value at Procore.
